# the SMK-37's store (app.h: the pool at 0xC2000, the pairs at 0xE6000 / 0xE8000, OBJ_BLE in the settings pair):
# a project saved, the FM-1 restarted, the project back; the resource region (the 909 cymbals) read in place
wait 300
tap HOME
expect page Arrange
spin K1 20
wait 40
expect tempo 140
tap SAVE
wait 150
expect dirty 0
reboot
wait 300
expect tempo 140
turn ALGO 1
wait 30
tap SEQ
wait 30
pad 0 down 100
wait 30
pad 0 up
wait 60
expect note 2 1 1 60
tap SAVE
wait 150
reboot
wait 300
expect note 2 1 1 60
shot persist.png
